.TH ALI-BACKUP 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-backup \- home-folder backups with dice-named snapshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-backup
.RI [ destdir ]
.br
.B ali-backup restore
.I snapshot.tgz
.br
.B ali-backup list
.RI [ destdir ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tars $HOME to
.I home-DATE-XXXXXX.tgz
in the first removable mount, else ~/Backups. Skips caches,
trash and the Backups folder itself.
.B restore
asks for YES before overwriting $HOME.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ali-vault (1),
.BR terry-dice (1)
